# AEGIS-DocIntel Software License & Dual-Licensing Architecture

**Current status note (added October 2026):** This software is under active development and is not yet offered under a paid commercial license to any customer. This license text describes the evaluation/research license for the experimental platform and the intended future commercial terms for the full platform. The `aegis-docprep` package (see [/aegis-docprep](aegis-docprep/)) is separately licensed under Apache 2.0 and is available for open use today.

---

## 1. Open-Core Component: aegis-docprep
The extracted, standalone package located at `/aegis-docprep` (providing spatial reading-order extraction, submodular context packing, and PII redaction) is licensed under the **Apache License, Version 2.0**.
See [aegis-docprep/LICENSE](aegis-docprep/LICENSE) for the full permissive open-source license terms.

---

